# Golden files, BLE traces and dive exports are private dive data (Docs/DECISIONS.md, Q3).
# They belong outside the repository (~/BlueDive-Fixtures, passed by DCK_GOLDEN_DIR /
# BLUEDIVE_PARITY_DIR). These rules only catch copies dropped into the bundled fixtures
# folder by mistake; the committed synthetic fixtures (*.json there) stay tracked.
Tests/DiveComputerKitTests/Fixtures/golden*/
Tests/DiveComputerKitTests/Fixtures/traces/
Tests/DiveComputerKitTests/Fixtures/mapper-parity/
Tests/DiveComputerKitTests/Fixtures/exports/
Tests/DiveComputerKitTests/Fixtures/**/*.log
Tests/DiveComputerKitTests/Fixtures/**/*.bluedive
Tests/DiveComputerKitTests/Fixtures/**/*.xml
# Loose private files dropped directly in the fixtures folder: a golden set's manifest and
# per-dive golden files (<8-hex serial>_<16-hex sha>.json).
Tests/DiveComputerKitTests/Fixtures/manifest.json
